# PlayEffect.java: Jace's Mindseeker's ETB mills five of the opponent's
# cards (RememberMilled$), then its DB$ Play | ValidZone$ Graveyard,Exile |
# Valid$ Instant.IsRemembered,Sorcery.IsRemembered | Controller$ You |
# WithoutManaCost$ True | Optional$ True lets its controller cast the one
# instant among them for free. One candidate and Amount$ 1 make it Java's
# singleOption: a yes/no confirm, no pick. Lightning Bolt is cast from the
# opponent's graveyard under human's control (CR 110.2), goes on the stack
# above the resolving trigger, resolves next (CR 608.2g, ADR-0018), and
# returns to its owner's graveyard.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 U
tapformana human 3 U
tapformana human 4 U
tapformana human 5 U
tapformana human 6 U
tapformana human 7 U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
castspell human 1
queue targets ai
queue confirmeffect true
queue targets ai
resolvestack
